            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "illness, accident or injury. Although not an exclusive list, typical usage would be for heart attack, cancer, automobile accident or major surgery. The Bank is not intended to provide benefits to those members having elective surgery or normal maternity-related cases. Upon approval of the application by the Personnel Department, a member may draw from the Bank up to a maximum of one hundred (100) paid sick leave days for each period of extended illness, accident or injury, subject to the following provisions:",
            "block_bbox": [
                108,
                101,
                520,
                264
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 0,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    108.0,
                    101.0
                ],
                [
                    520.0,
                    101.0
                ],
                [
                    520.0,
                    264.0
                ],
                [
                    108.0,
                    264.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Drawing of sick leave days is based upon availability of sick leave days in the Bank. In no case shall this leave be granted beyond the number of days in the Bank.",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                264,
                519,
                317
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    110.0,
                    264.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    264.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    317.0
                ],
                [
                    110.0,
                    317.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Members shall not have to pay back in any manner the number of days used from the Bank except as outlined in the Abuse of Benefits section and eligibility section.",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                318,
                519,
                371
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    110.0,
                    318.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    318.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    371.0
                ],
                [
                    110.0,
                    371.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Any sick leave drawn from the Bank by a participating member must be used for said member's personal illness, accident or injury.",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                371,
                520,
                424
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    109.52262878417969,
                    371.2647399902344
                ],
                [
                    518.961669921875,
                    367.1703796386719
                ],
                [
                    519.4799194335938,
                    418.9952087402344
                ],
                [
                    110.04087829589844,
                    423.0895690917969
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. Should this benefit be terminated by death, the member's eligibility shall cease upon the day that death occurs.",
            "block_bbox": [
                111,
                424,
                520,
                460
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    111.0,
                    424.0
                ],
                [
                    520.0,
                    424.0
                ],
                [
                    520.0,
                    460.0
                ],
                [
                    111.0,
                    460.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. Eligibility shall be based upon the duty days associated with the contract of the member.",
            "block_bbox": [
                111,
                461,
                521,
                496
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
